      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}: Even a collider on the MirrorReflection layer can make it very complicated to select an \"Interact()\"Udon-Button inside it on desktop, so while the issue described in the Canny is still there, the MirrorReflection workaround is also not problem-free either. It works on certain angles, but a lot of angles don't work properly.",
